{
  "borough": "Stanmore",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;4&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The development has failed to\r\n     demonstrate appropriate access for fire tenders and in the absence of a\r\n     sufficient Fire Statement demonstrating how the safety of building users\r\n     would be met, identifying suitably positioned unobstructed outside space\r\n     for fire appliances and an evacuation assembly point, and how the proposed\r\n     building would achieve the highest standards of fire safety, the\r\n     development would be contrary to Policy D12 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;4&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;",
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;2&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of its\r\n     inadequate outlook for future occupiers would result in a poor standard of\r\n     living accommodation for future occupiers to the detriment of their\r\n     residential amenity, Furthermore, due to the siting, proximity to\r\n     boundaries, bulk, scale, height and massing the development would result\r\n     in an overbearing impact and loss of outlook for properties within the\r\n     studio flats. As such, the proposal is contrary to the\r\n     National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D3.D(7) of The London\r\n     Plan (2021), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2013), and policy DM1\r\n     and DM2 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)\r\n     and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide\r\n     Supplementary Planning Document (2010).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;2&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;",
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;3&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The development fails to\r\n     adequately demonstrate suitable arrangements for the collection and/or\r\n     movement of bins to and from an appropriate collection point with suitable\r\n     access for the Council’s waste contractors. The development has also\r\n     failed to adequately demonstrate appropriate and functional servicing\r\n     arrangements and therefore fails to achieve a satisfactory form of\r\n     development, contrary to Policies DM1 and DM45 of the Harrow Develop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;ment\r\n     Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;3&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;",
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposed new dwellings, by\r\n     reason of their cramped backland siting, uncharacteristic positioning; along\r\n     with their bulk, scale, massing and site location, would&amp;nbsp;form an\r\n     isolated, incongruous, unsympathetic and contrived development, that would\r\n     be unduly at odds with the established pattern of development. The\r\n     proposal would therefore be contrary to the high quality design\r\n     aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies\r\n     D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the\r\n     Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development\r\n     Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary\r\n     Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;"
  ],
